# T10 live run: partner request page redesign. Copy database aiccradb_partreq_test only, HEAD a523ea9f89 + uncommitted T10 files, built in a throwaway worktree.
# Email: custom_parameters 2184 (crp_enable_email_notification, unit 45) set to false on the COPY for the run, restored to true afterwards.
# Counts below are partner_requests / email_logs on the copy.

== A. Submit with nothing filled (click save after the page JS initialised)
  before 5215 / 18295 -> after 5215 / 18295
